<section style="background: rgb(223, 221, 208); padding: 72px 24px;"><div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0px auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16.8px;">Customer Care</p><h1 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 34px; line-height: 40px; font-weight: 400;">Privacy Policy</h1><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22.4px; max-width: 620px;">What we collect when you visit or shop with Amun Organics, how we use it, and the choices you have.</p></div></section>
<section style="padding: 72px 24px;"><div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0px auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 42px 72px; align-items: flex-start;"><nav aria-label="Policies" style="flex: 1 1 220px; max-width: 280px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);"><a href="/pages/shipping-and-returns" style="padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;">Shipping &amp; Returns</a><a href="/pages/klarna-payments" style="padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;">Klarna Payments</a><a href="/pages/payment-terms-conditions" style="padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;">Payment Terms</a><a href="/pages/privacy-policy" aria-current="page" style="padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px; text-decoration: underline;">Privacy Policy</a></nav><div style="flex: 3 1 560px; min-width: 0px; max-width: 760px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 42px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16.8px;">Last updated November 2026</p><div style="border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; font-weight: 400;">Information We Collect</h2><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 24px; padding: 18px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="flex: 1 1 180px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;">Information you give us</span><span style="flex: 2 1 320px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;">Your name, email, shipping and billing address, and phone number when you order, create an account, contact us or join our list.</span></div><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 24px; padding: 18px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="flex: 1 1 180px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;">Order information</span><span style="flex: 2 1 320px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;">The products you buy, your subscription schedule and your order history. Card details are handled by our payment providers, not stored by us.</span></div><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 24px; padding: 18px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="flex: 1 1 180px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;">Device &amp; usage</span><span style="flex: 2 1 320px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;">Your browser, device, IP address and the pages you view, collected through cookies and similar technologies.</span></div></div></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; font-weight: 400;">How We Use It</h2><ul style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px;"><li>To process, ship and support your orders and subscriptions</li><li>To reply to your questions and requests</li><li>To send emails you signed up for, such as new formulas and offers</li><li>To keep our store secure and prevent fraud</li><li>To understand how our site is used and improve it</li></ul></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; font-weight: 400;">Sharing Your Information</h2><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px;">We do not sell your personal information. We share it only with the partners who help us run our store, such as our ecommerce platform, payment providers including Klarna, shipping carriers and email service, and only as needed to provide their service. We may also share information when required by law.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; font-weight: 400;">Cookies</h2><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px;">Cookies keep your cart and preferences, and help us measure how the site performs. You can manage or turn off cookies in your browser settings, though some parts of the store may not work as intended.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; font-weight: 400;">Your Choices &amp; Rights</h2><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px;">You can unsubscribe from our emails at any time using the link at the bottom of each message. Depending on where you live, you may also have the right to access, correct or delete your personal information. To make a request, <a href="/pages/contact-us" style="text-decoration: underline;">contact us</a>.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; font-weight: 400;">Data Retention &amp; Security</h2><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px;">We keep your information only as long as needed for the purposes above or as required by law, and we use reasonable safeguards to protect it.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px 0px 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; font-weight: 400;">Changes to This Policy</h2><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px;">We may update this policy from time to time. When we do, we will change the date at the top of this page.</p></div><div style="margin-top: 60px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px;"><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;"><span style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 25.2px;">Questions about your privacy?</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;">We usually reply within 1-2 business days.</span></div><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px;"><a href="/pages/contact-us" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; height: 50px; padding: 0px 24px; background: rgb(88, 81, 40); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px;">Contact Us</a><a href="/pages/faqs" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; height: 50px; padding: 0px 24px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box;">Read the FAQ</a></div></div></div></div></section>
